Subdomain ReportCard of StudentAcademicRecord
    documentation "A Student has a ReportCard for each GradingPeriod. A Grade is associated with each Section. For early grade levels, a StudentCompetencyObjective is assigned to CompetencyObjectives, for example, assigning a ""Satisfactory"" for ""Participates in class discussions."""
